iness_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","review_id":"35m9_YA6H5xWHAxweq7NQA","date":"2019-03-25T17:02:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9436839818954468,"text_excerpt":"I like this place. It's a nice place to grab a glass of wine. They have a store attached so you can easily grab a bottle of something you had at the bar. Service is always nice. Parking can suck sometimes because there's a lot in that strip plus guests of residents park as well. Reasonable prices for glasses of wine. They often have pop-ups but generally no food option (only drawback). I've been going for a couple of years now. I'll go back."},{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","review_id":"Giktw61eqoT_MWup9yKQHw","date":"2016-07-23T22:09:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398818016052246,"text_excerpt":"I'm impressed with this place. I went during their garage sale, and figured I would just pick and choose and hope my selections (mainly based on price) were decent. Luckily as I was looking around one of the friendly staff members asked what kind of wines I liked, and assisted me with my selections. It was so nice. I feel like I know wine, but some places still intimidate me with their pretentiousness.. not this place...it was down to earth in a great way. I really can't wait to return and attend one of their wine tastings. Oh ya, and my selections were fabulous!"},{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","review_id":"bnnhvxVMQsg1S2KjDIy_tw","date":"2014-07-11T18:48:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364457130432129,"text_excerpt":"I'd been to this establishment when it was Cork & Bottle a long time ago, but hadn't been back till earlier this year. Having been there multiple times and can honestly give them 5 stars. I've found parking in the skinny parking lot as well as alongside Orleans. Parking is a little bit more difficult on Thursdays when they have the Farmers Market, but never that bad. Plus this place is close enough for me to ride my bike, if I weren't so lazy. The inside is spacious with a store as you walk in with an extensive wine collection, beers by the pack or by the bottle, and a good bit of liquors as well to choose from. They have a bar in the shop for wine tastings, and will set up chairs for mor..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","photo_id":"azUxo3qw9uFlPl6wyGxBLw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/azUxo3qw9uFlPl6wyGxBLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8548483848571777},{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","photo_id":"6nECkldHE9MMnRzJ1NL20Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/6nECkldHE9MMnRzJ1NL20Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8463481068611145},{"business_id":"1788xIG9VRrs3DZ_RhqA6A","photo_id":"SVfrlxUy5avbS94JqUf28w","la